  "content": "## Task\nImprove the post-route quality of `priority32` (32-bit registered priority encoder: index of the highest set bit of a, plus a found flag) without changing its behavior.\n\n## Specification (current RTL, also the equivalence reference)\n```verilog\nmodule priority32 (\n    input wire clk,\n    input wire rst_n,\n    input wire valid_i,\n    input wire [31:0] a_i,\n    input wire [31:0] b_i,\n    output reg valid_o,\n    output reg [5:0] y_o\n);\n\nwire hit_0 = |a_i[31:0];\nwire [4:0] idx_0 = a_i[31] ? 5'd31 : a_i[30] ? 5'd30 : a_i[29] ? 5'd29 : a_i[28] ? 5'd28 : a_i[27] ? 5'd27 : a_i[26] ? 5'd26 : a_i[25] ? 5'd25 : a_i[24] ? 5'd24 : a_i[23] ? 5'd23 : a_i[22] ? 5'd22 : a_i[21] ? 5'd21 : a_i[20] ? 5'd20 : a_i[19] ? 5'd19 : a_i[18] ? 5'd18 : a_i[17] ? 5'd17 : a_i[16] ? 5'd16 : a_i[15] ? 5'd15 : a_i[14] ? 5'd14 : a_i[13] ? 5'd13 : a_i[12] ? 5'd12 : a_i[11] ? 5'd11 : a_i[10] ? 5'd10 : a_i[9] ? 5'd9 : a_i[8] ? 5'd8 : a_i[7] ? 5'd7 : a_i[6] ? 5'd6 : a_i[5] ? 5'd5 : a_i[4] ? 5'd4 : a_i[3] ? 5'd3 : a_i[2] ? 5'd2 : a_i[1] ? 5'd1 : a_i[0] ? 5'd0 : 5'd0;\n\nwire [5:0] chosen_0 = hit_0 ? {1'b1, idx_0} : 6'd0;\n\nalways @(posedge clk) begin\n    if (!rst_n) begin\n        valid_o <= 1'b0;\n        y_o <= 6'd0;\n    end else begin\n        valid_o <= valid_i;\n        if (valid_i)\n            y_o <= chosen_0;\n    end\nend\nendmodule\n```\nYour design must be cycle-for-cycle equivalent to this module from reset: same ports, synchronous active-low reset, `valid_o` follows `valid_i` one cycle later, and `y_o` updates only on valid cycles and holds otherwise.\n\n## Flow and objective\nYosys/ABC synthesis to the Nangate45 library, then OpenROAD placement, clock tree synthesis and routing with a 10 ns clock and a fixed floorplan. Score = 10 * WNS_ns - 0.001 * area_um2, where WNS is the worst setup slack after routing and area is total standard-cell area. Higher is better.\n\nThis RTL measured: area 208.81 um^2, WNS 7.64557 ns, score 76.24689.\n\n## Rules\n- One m